&_nc_oc=AdpOoWuUDH_FiUC_JyRdxxRUW_v48eZ_AJqVJ0FBTtGxDlKl1zDMn-euPY45ta_LD5M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyBP3mjM3SX7sE3W9j6SoM4XfdlFtMLmhwxe7afYUfH_A&oe=69C3C3FE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=52RhuplAkpAQ7kNvwHD_cqP&_nc_oc=Adq_ihNxpo0MkMWVq6LmiLjQVhZch8-DdLd08AlHTM6BKh4q8o0N6q3db6Br7islchQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afyy0N1jM18NaQT9WKiMnWcfD4fEpPd4njWTMII9QP33YQ&oe=69C3D4FC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p2dpRKFrh00Q7kNvwG2Eg0f&_nc_oc=AdoSDoK-KVRjY6W6zHu_PIY_Mp_KSt10XqB8s3bURhpuFR0DiPKy6OBRrSRjRlbaU68&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afzj_IS7GnqXCZJaVjVpoacA0xUYb52Ho5kGO11LVbaI1A&oe=69C3BB47"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MmO6RsaU9WQQ7kNvwGVPCjq&_nc_oc=AdoAZrWatEf6PlgF9WqcUMYQKVEaxJHsPqfcrgkYaQ_yDD3P77jgt6ZInWrbClSng0U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzRJVPm2qEzvxPBi5L3Nu5hACwwTc3p-P6iFhUO92MWKQ&oe=69C3DF55"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xle5DtTbwa8Q7kNvwHkQVAu&_nc_oc=Adp6WsBAoSpLXb28_oLTTk5zJXnbr8c7l_zgPiIwKwrpT_HfFvV3B7DzfLh0G_sSfw4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afycq6AIfjPIFwv0cEdU4Lp15_ONVGT1zLWIScSV8_VMMQ&oe=69C3EBE4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.